            <div xml:id="d113">

                <pb facs="0180" n="146" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg146"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 113.</note>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Davis to Mr.
                        Read.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1870-08-20"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >August</hi> 20, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Read,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul General</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Paris:</hi></p>
                <p>Bank with Monroe &amp; Co., if necessary. Accept any funds at such discount as
                    will purchase exchange on London, without loss, and convert into such exchange.
                    Use your own discretion in emergency.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>DAVIS.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
